# Widescreen display from LBA2's menu over a game in play, SaveAnywhere
# ON, on a display of 1920x1080 (fixtures/widesa: the saves of
# fixtures/saves, outside the prison's back door, and its lba.cfg with
# WideScreen: OFF, recorded with -D 1920x1080). Load Game loads
# Cyd, and Escape leaves the game for LBA2's menu over it. Its Options
# Menu opens the option menu, Saved games management out of it and
# Widescreen display: OFF its sixth entry, and Return turns it ON: the
# scene drawn again under the menus on the whole screen of 852x480.
# Escape goes back to LBA2's menu, and Resume Game draws the scene on
# the whole screen of 852x480.

hold 0.05
sleep 40
shot menu
key Down Return
sleep 3
key Down Down
sleep 1
key Return
hold 0.15
sleep 12
shot start
hold 0.05
key Escape
sleep 3
shot lba2menu
key Down Down Down Down
sleep 1
key Return
sleep 3
shot options
key Down Down Down Down Down
sleep 1
key Return
sleep 2
shot on
key Escape
sleep 3
shot back
key Return
sleep 5
shot resumed
